---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Thompson's NFA"
  description="A regex engine written in Go with Thompson's construction, compiled to WebAssembly, animating its state machine as it reads your input."
>
  <div class="tn">
    <section class="tn-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">playground</p>
      <h1>Thompson's NFA, one character at a time</h1>
      <p class="tn-lede">
        Type a regular expression and a string. A regex engine written in Go,
        compiled to WebAssembly and running in this page, builds the pattern
        into a state machine and reads your string through it. Every lit lamp
        is a state the machine is in, and it can be in many at once.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="tn-machine" aria-label="Regex state machine">
      <div class="fields">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="tn-pattern">Pattern</label>
          <div class="box">
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span><input
              id="tn-pattern"
              spellcheck="false"
              autocomplete="off"
              autocapitalize="off"
              maxlength="80"
              aria-describedby="tn-pattern-error"
            /><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          </div>
          <div class="error" id="tn-pattern-error" role="status"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="tn-input">Input string</label>
          <div class="box">
            <input id="tn-input" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" maxlength="48" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="presets" id="tn-presets"><span>Try</span></div>

      <div class="graph" id="tn-graph-wrap">
        <svg id="tn-graph" role="img" aria-label="State machine diagram"></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="legend" aria-hidden="true">
        <span><svg width="18" height="18"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8" fill="var(--off)" stroke="var(--dim)" stroke-width="1.4"></circle></svg>reads one character</span>
        <span><svg width="14" height="14"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5.5" fill="var(--off)" stroke="var(--dim)" stroke-width="1.4"></circle></svg>junction, reads nothing</span>
        <span><svg width="30" height="10"><line x1="0" y1="5" x2="30" y2="5" stroke="var(--dim)" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="1.2"></line></svg>ε, a free move</span>
        <span><svg width="18" height="18"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8" fill="var(--off)" stroke="var(--dim)" stroke-width="1.4"></circle><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="5" fill="none" stroke="var(--dim)"></circle></svg>accepting state</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tape-window" id="tn-tape-window" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="tape" id="tn-tape"></div>
        <div class="head"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="controls">
        <button class="btn" id="tn-b-reset" title="Back to the start (Home)"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><rect x="0" y="1" width="2" height="10"></rect><path d="M12 1v10L3 6z"></path></svg>Restart</button>
        <button class="btn" id="tn-b-back" title="Previous character (Left arrow)"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M10 1v10L2 6z"></path></svg>Back</button>
        <button class="btn primary" id="tn-b-play" title="Play or pause (Space)"></button>
        <button class="btn" id="tn-b-step" title="Next character (Right arrow)">Step<svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 1v10l8-5z"></path></svg></button>
        <label class="speed">Speed <input type="range" id="tn-speed" min="0.25" max="3" step="0.25" value="1" /><output id="tn-speed-out">1×</output></label>
        <div class="verdict idle" id="tn-verdict" role="status"><i></i><span>Ready</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="readout">
        <p class="narration" id="tn-narration" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div>
          <p class="log-title">Lamp log: which states were lit after each character</p>
          <div class="log" id="tn-log"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="tn-article">
      <h2>What you're looking at</h2>
      <p>
        Each circle is a state. Large circles read exactly one character, and
        the label on their arrow says which. Small circles are junctions: they
        read nothing, and their dashed ε-arrows are moves the machine may take
        for free. The machine starts at the state with the arrow coming in from
        nowhere. When the input runs out, the string matches if the double
        circle is lit.
      </p>
      <p>
        The engine anchors at both ends, so the whole string has to match. Wrap
        a pattern in <code>.*( … ).*</code> to search inside a longer string
        instead.
      </p>

      <h2>Building the machine</h2>
      <p>
        Ken Thompson described this construction in 1968. It compiles a pattern
        bottom-up, and each piece becomes a fragment: a start state plus a list
        of arrows that don't point anywhere yet. Every operator does the same
        small thing. It makes a state or two, then aims the loose arrows. Here
        is what each operator produces on its own, drawn by the same engine as
        the machine above.
      </p>
      <div class="figs" id="tn-figs"></div>
      <p>
        This is the whole of <code>*</code>, from <code>nfa.go</code>. The call
        to <code>e.patch(s.ID)</code> aims every loose arrow of the inner
        fragment back at the new junction, and that is the loop.
      </p>
      <pre><code>{`case nStar:
	e := b.build(n.left)
	s := b.newState(KindSplit)
	s.Out = e.start
	e.patch(s.ID)
	return frag{s.ID, []*int{&s.Out1}}`}</code></pre>

      <h2>Running it without guessing</h2>
      <p>
        A backtracking engine follows one path at a time. When a guess fails it
        rewinds and tries the next one, and on patterns like <code>(x+x+)+y</code> the
        number of ways to split the input grows
        exponentially. Thompson's simulation never guesses. It carries the set
        of every state the machine could be in, and each character turns that
        set into the next one. A state enters the set at most once per
        character, so matching takes time proportional to the length of the
        input times the number of states, whatever the pattern is. Go's own <code>regexp</code> package
        is built on the same guarantee.
      </p>
      <pre><code>{`for _, id := range clist {
	s := n.States[id]
	if s.consumes(r) {
		nlist = m.add(nlist, s.Out, -1) // add follows ε-arrows too
	}
}
clist, nlist = nlist, clist`}</code></pre>
      <p>
        Watch the set stay small on the classic trap. Twenty x's with no y
        takes a backtracker millions of steps; here it is twenty steps, each
        touching a handful of states.
      </p>
      <p><button class="inline-btn" id="tn-load-trap">Load the backtracking trap</button></p>

      <h2>The source</h2>
      <p>
        The engine is a few hundred lines of Go with no dependencies: a
        recursive-descent parser, the construction, the simulation, and tests
        that check 3,000 random patterns against Go's <code>regexp</code> package. This
        page runs that exact code. Read it at <a class="link" href="https://github.com/swayam5342/thompson">github.com/swayam5342/thompson</a>.
      </p>
    </article>

    <p class="tn-engine" id="tn-engine">Loading the engine…</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Globals for visualizer.js; classic scripts run before the module below. -->
  <script is:inline src="/thompson/dagre.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="/thompson/wasm_exec.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import { boot } from "../../lib/thompson/visualizer.js";
  boot();
</script>

<style is:global>
  /* Everything is scoped under .tn: most of these elements are created by
     visualizer.js, which Astro's scoped styles can't reach. The machine's own
     palette is derived from the site theme tokens. */
  .tn {
    --panel: var(--bg-raised);
    --dim: var(--ink-soft);
    --off: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink-soft) 16%, var(--bg));
    --lamp: var(--accent);
    --lamp-ink: var(--bg);
    --lamp-glow: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, transparent);
    --eps: var(--ink);
    --ok: light-dark(#1a7f37, #3fb950);
    --bad: light-dark(#cf222e, #f85149);
    --paper: #ece1c2;
    --paper-edge: #d9cba3;
    --paper-ink: #3a3326;
    --hole: light-dark(#2a3239, var(--bg));

    max-width: 70rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 4rem;
  }
  .tn code,
  .tn kbd {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.88em;
  }
  .tn button,
  .tn input {
    font: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .tn-intro {
    padding: 3rem 0 1.5rem;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .tn-intro h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin: 0.3rem 0 0.8rem;
  }
  .tn-lede {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---------- the machine ---------- */
  .tn-machine {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 18px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    scroll-margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .tn .fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  .tn .field label { display: block; font: 500 0.78rem/1 var(--font-mono); color: var(--dim); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .tn .field .box {
    display: flex; align-items: center; background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 0 12px;
  }
  .tn .field .box:focus-within { border-color: var(--lamp); }
  .tn .field .box span { font: 500 20px var(--font-mono); color: var(--dim); }
  .tn .field input {
    flex: 1; min-width: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; outline: none;
    font: 500 19px/1 var(--font-mono); padding: 12px 4px;
  }
  .tn .field input[aria-invalid="true"] { color: var(--bad); }
  .tn .error { font: 13px/1.5 var(--font-mono); color: var(--bad); margin-top: 8px; white-space: pre; overflow-x: auto; }
  .tn .error:empty { display: none; }
  .tn .presets { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline; }
  .tn .presets > span { font: 13px var(--font-mono); color: var(--dim); margin-right: 4px; }
  .tn .preset {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: transparent; border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 5px 10px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .tn .preset:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .tn .preset code { font-size: 13px; }
  .tn .preset small { display: block; color: var(--dim); font: 12px var(--font-mono); }

  .tn .graph {
    position: relative; overflow: auto; border-radius: 6px; min-height: 180px;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    background-image: radial-gradient(var(--line) 1px, transparent 1.2px);
    background-size: 18px 18px;
    display: flex; align-items: center;
  }
  .tn .graph svg { display: block; margin: 0 auto; flex: none; }
  .tn .graph.stale svg { opacity: .3; }

  /* graph parts */
  .tn .edge { fill: none; stroke: var(--dim); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .tn .edge.eps { stroke-dasharray: 4 4; stroke-width: 1.15; }
  .tn .edge.hot { stroke: var(--lamp); stroke-width: 2.6; stroke-dasharray: none; }
  .tn .edge.flow { stroke: var(--eps); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .tn .arrowhead { fill: var(--dim); }
  .tn .arrowhead.hot { fill: var(--lamp); }
  .tn .arrowhead.flow { fill: var(--eps); }
  .tn .elabel rect { fill: var(--panel); stroke: var(--line); }
  .tn .elabel text { font: 500 12px var(--font-mono); fill: var(--ink); text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: central; }
  .tn .elabel.hot rect { stroke: var(--lamp); fill: var(--lamp); }
  .tn .elabel.hot text { fill: var(--lamp-ink); }
  .tn .state .body { fill: var(--off); stroke: var(--dim); stroke-width: 1.4; transition: fill .15s, stroke .15s; }
  .tn .state .ring { fill: none; stroke: var(--dim); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .tn .state text { font: 500 11px var(--font-mono); fill: var(--dim); text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: central; pointer-events: none; }
  .tn .state.junction text { font-size: 9px; }
  .tn .state .halo { fill: var(--lamp-glow); opacity: 0; transition: opacity .2s; }
  .tn .state.was .body { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--lamp) 30%, var(--off)); stroke: color-mix(in srgb, var(--lamp) 60%, var(--dim)); }
  .tn .state.on .body { fill: var(--lamp); stroke: var(--lamp); }
  .tn .state.on text { fill: var(--lamp-ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .tn .state.on .ring { stroke: var(--lamp-ink); }
  .tn .state.on .halo { opacity: 1; }
  .tn .state.win .body { fill: var(--ok); stroke: var(--ok); }
  .tn .state.win .halo { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ok) 55%, transparent); }
  .tn .start-arrow { stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .tn .pulse { fill: var(--lamp); }
  .tn .pulse.flow { fill: var(--eps); }
  .tn .mini .state text { display: none; }

  /* paper tape */
  .tn .tape-window {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden; height: 128px; border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--bg);
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 12%, #000 88%, transparent);
            mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 12%, #000 88%, transparent);
  }
  .tn .tape {
    position: absolute; top: 14px; left: 0; display: flex; height: 100px;
    background: var(--paper); border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-edge); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-edge);
    transition: transform .32s cubic-bezier(.3,.7,.3,1);
  }
  .tn .frame {
    width: 38px; flex: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
    padding-top: 7px; gap: 2px; cursor: pointer; position: relative;
  }
  .tn .frame.leader { cursor: default; }
  .tn .hole { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .tn .hole.punched { background: var(--hole); }
  .tn .hole.feed { width: 4px; height: 4px; background: var(--hole); margin: 1.5px 0; }
  .tn .glyph { font: 600 15px/1 var(--font-mono); color: var(--paper-ink); margin-top: 6px; height: 16px; opacity: .35; }
  .tn .frame.read .glyph { opacity: .9; }
  .tn .frame.read { background: rgba(0,0,0,.05); }
  .tn .frame.current .glyph { opacity: 1; }
  .tn .frame.skipped .glyph { text-decoration: line-through; opacity: .3; }
  .tn .head {
    position: absolute; top: 6px; bottom: 6px; width: 46px; left: 50%; margin-left: -23px;
    border: 2px solid var(--lamp); border-radius: 5px; pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* controls */
  .tn .controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .tn .btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; cursor: pointer;
    font: 500 0.8rem/1 var(--font-mono); padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: var(--bg);
  }
  .tn .btn:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .tn .btn:disabled { opacity: .4; cursor: default; }
  .tn .btn svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; fill: currentColor; }
  .tn .btn.primary { background: var(--lamp); border-color: var(--lamp); color: var(--lamp-ink); font-weight: 600; min-width: 92px; }
  .tn .btn.primary:hover:not(:disabled) { filter: brightness(1.12); }
  .tn .speed { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font: 0.8rem var(--font-mono); color: var(--dim); margin-left: 6px; }
  .tn .speed input { width: 96px; accent-color: var(--lamp); }
  .tn .verdict { margin-left: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font: 600 0.85rem var(--font-mono); }
  .tn .verdict i { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--off); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: inline-block; }
  .tn .verdict.match i { background: var(--ok); border-color: var(--ok); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--ok); }
  .tn .verdict.nomatch i { background: var(--bad); border-color: var(--bad); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--bad); }
  .tn .verdict.match { color: var(--ok); }
  .tn .verdict.nomatch { color: var(--bad); }
  .tn .verdict.idle { color: var(--dim); font-weight: 500; }

  .tn .readout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 18px; align-items: start; }
  .tn .narration { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 60ch; min-height: 5.5em; }
  .tn .narration code { background: var(--bg); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: var(--radius); }
  .tn .log-title { font: 500 0.78rem var(--font-mono); color: var(--dim); margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .tn .log { position: relative; overflow: auto; max-height: 250px; }
  .tn .log-grid { position: relative; display: grid; gap: 2px; font: 10px/12px var(--font-mono); width: max-content; }
  .tn .log-grid .lbl { color: var(--dim); text-align: right; padding-right: 6px; }
  .tn .log-grid .lbl.cons { color: var(--ink); }
  .tn .log-grid .hd { text-align: center; color: var(--dim); }
  .tn .log-grid .c { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--off); cursor: pointer; }
  .tn .log-grid .c.on { background: var(--lamp); }
  .tn .log-grid .c.acc.on { background: var(--ok); }
  .tn .log-cursor { position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 14px; margin-left: -1px; border: 1px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 3px; pointer-events: none; }
  .tn .log-future { position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0; background: var(--panel); opacity: .82; pointer-events: none; }

  .tn .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; font: 0.75rem var(--font-mono); color: var(--dim); }
  .tn .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
  .tn .legend svg { overflow: visible; }

  /* ---------- article ---------- */
  .tn-article { max-width: var(--measure); margin-top: 3.5rem; }
  .tn-article h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 2.4em 0 0.7em; }
  .tn-article h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .tn-article p { margin: 0 0 1.2em; }
  .tn-article p code {
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    padding: 0.15em 0.4em;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .tn-article pre {
    background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.55; tab-size: 4;
    margin: 0 0 1.2em;
  }
  .tn .figs {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 22px 18px;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem; width: min(var(--measure-wide), calc(100vw - 3rem));
  }
  .tn .figs figure { margin: 0; }
  .tn .figs .graph { min-height: 110px; background-size: 14px 14px; }
  .tn .figs figcaption { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--dim); margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .tn .figs figcaption code { color: var(--ink); }
  .tn .inline-btn {
    font: 500 0.85rem var(--font-mono); border: 1px solid var(--lamp); color: var(--ink);
    background: transparent; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius); cursor: pointer;
  }
  .tn .inline-btn:hover { background: var(--accent-bg); }
  .tn-engine {
    margin: 3rem 0 0; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font: 0.78rem/1.6 var(--font-mono); color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .tn { padding: 0 1rem 3rem; }
    .tn-intro { padding-top: 2rem; }
    .tn .fields, .tn .readout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tn .figs { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); width: 100%; }
    .tn-machine { padding: 14px; }
    .tn .presets { flex-wrap: nowrap; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 4px; }
    .tn .preset { flex: none; }
    .tn .verdict { margin-left: 0; width: 100%; }
    .tn .speed { margin-left: 0; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .tn .tape, .tn .state .body, .tn .state .halo { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
